<title>USA: ERLY Industries stake cut by group.</title>
<headline>ERLY Industries stake cut by group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Los Angeles investor Michael Tenzer said Wednesday it cut its stake in ERLY Industries Inc to 276,666 common shares, or 5.8 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 145,000 common shares between December 19 and January 7 at prices ranging from $6.875 to $7.625 per share.</p>
